{"id":"composer_000020","name":"卡米尔·圣-桑","originalName":"Camille Saint-Saëns","aliases":["圣-桑","圣桑","夏尔·卡米尔·圣-桑","Camille Saint-Saëns","Charles-Camille Saint-Saëns","Saint-Saëns","Saint-Saens"],"birthYear":1835,"deathYear":1921,"nationality":"法国","period":"浪漫主义","introduction":"法国作曲家、钢琴家、管风琴家，神童出身，寿高八十六岁，亲历了从柏辽兹到德彪西的整个世纪。他写作体裁极广：五部钢琴协奏曲、三部小提琴协奏曲、大提琴协奏曲、交响诗《骷髅之舞》、歌剧《参孙与达莉拉》、组曲《动物狂欢节》都是常演曲目。他是法国音乐协会的创始人之一，为法国器乐音乐的复兴铺路。","styleSummary":"技法精熟、清澈优雅，带古典式的克制与法兰西的机敏色彩。","completeness":"complete","status":"published","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","sources":[{"id":"wikipedia-en-camille-saint-saens","title":"Camille Saint-Saëns","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camille_Saint-Sa%C3%ABns","publisher":"English Wikipedia","accessedAt":"2026-08-27","supports":["name","birthYear","deathYear","nationality","period","introduction"]}],"works":[{"id":"work_000061","composerId":"composer_000020","composerName":"卡米尔·圣-桑","title":"F大调第五钢琴协奏曲「埃及」","originalTitle":"Piano Concerto No. 5 in F major, Op. 103 \"Egyptian\"","opus":"Op. 103","genre":"钢琴协奏曲","periodKey":"romantic","genreFamily":"concerto","durationMinutes":23,"difficulty":"容易进入","tags":["圣-桑","钢琴协奏曲","浪漫主义","埃及","异国情调"],"summary":"圣-桑1896年在埃及卢克索写成的最后一部钢琴协奏曲，第二乐章引用了他在尼罗河上听到的努比亚情歌，故称「埃及」。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_cb18a92da70b7624"],"upcomingEventCount":1}],"upcomingEventIds":["perf_cb18a92da70b7624"],"upcomingEventCount":1}